<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>

    <body class="page">
        <%- include('partials/nav') %>
            <main>
                <section>
                    <div class="montey-banner">
                        <img src="/img/montey-java.png" alt="CST336 Mascot">
                    </div>
                    <h1>Faker-js</h1>
                    <p class="sources"><a href="https://github.com/faker-js/faker" target="_blank">Faker-js</a> is a
                        library
                        for
                        generating fake data. Faker-js can generated a wide variety of fake data including names,
                        addresses, phone numbers, and more.
                    </p>

                    <p>The code below is a simple example of how to use Faker-js to generate fake data. When you refrest
                        the
                        page, new fake data will be generated and displayed after the => symbols.
                    </p>
                    <p><b>Code example: Refresh the page to see new fake data.</b></p>
                    <pre class="code-block-bg">
                        <code>
                         import { faker } from '@faker-js/faker';
                   
                         console.log(faker.person.fullName()); => <%= fakeData.name %>
                         console.log(faker.location.city());   => <%= fakeData.city %>
                         console.log(faker.phone.number());    => <%= fakeData.phone %></code>
                    </pre>
                    </p>

                </section>
                <section>
                    <h1>APILayer IPstack API Data</h1>
                    <p class="sources">The following information is retrieved using the
                        <a href="https://ipstack.com/" target="_blank">APILayer IPstack API</a> based on the user's IP
                        address. This information is based on the user's IP address and may not always be accurate.
                    </p>
                    <p><b>Note:</b>The API has a API rate limit, if you spam the refresh button too quickly, you may hit
                        the limit and the data will not update.</p>
                    <p><b>APILayer IPstack API Data:</b></p>
                    <ul class="features">
                        <li><b>User IP:</b>
                            <%= userIp %>
                        </li>
                        <li><b>Carrier:</b>
                            <%= ipData.carrier %>
                        </li>
                        <li><b>City/State:</b>
                            <%= ipData.cityState %>
                        </li>
                        <li><b>Connection Type:</b>
                            <%= ipData.connectionType %>
                        </li>
                        <li><b>Timezone:</b>
                            <%= ipData.timezone %>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
            </main>
            <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    </body>

</html>